---
layout: base.njk
title: BARS – Bars
permalink: /reference/project-axes/bars/
---

<header class="site-header axis-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">Reference / Project-specific axis</p>
  <h1>BARS</h1>
  <p>Bars.</p>
</header>

<div class="intro-content axis-page axis-evidence">
  <section>
    <h2>Recorded sources</h2>
    <p>
      The measurements file records one BARS source for each style. These are
      source records rather than a min/max specimen pair.
    </p>

    <div class="specimen-grid">
      {% for specimen in specimens.specimens %}
        {% if specimen.project == "amstelvar-a2"
          and specimen.axis == "BARS"
          and specimen.glyph == "dollar" %}
          <figure class="specimen-card">
            <button class="specimen-zoom" type="button">
              <img
                src="{{ ('/' + specimen.image) | url }}"
                alt="{{ specimen.style | capitalize }} dollar at {{ specimen.axis }} {{ specimen.source }}"
              >
            </button>
            <figcaption>
              {{ specimen.glyph }} · {{ specimen.style | capitalize }} ·
              {{ specimen.axis }} · {{ specimen.source }}
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
